            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Test with master branch:\n\n```bash\n$ /opt/neovim-temp/bin/nvim --version\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-1666+g9047ee1460\nBuild type: RelWithDebInfo\nLuaJIT 2.1.1788460057\n$ export NVIM_APPNAME=nvim-debug && /opt/neovim-temp/bin/nvim src/minimal_python/__init__.py\n```\n\nYields the same behaviour:\n\n```\nstack traceback:\n        /Users/chris/.config/nvim-debug/init.lua:37: in function 'notify'\n        /opt/neovim-temp/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/lsp/client.lua:865: in function 'notify'\n        /opt/neovim-temp/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/lsp/client.lua:1176: in function '_text_document_did_close_handler'\n        /opt/neovim-temp/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/lsp/client.lua:1466: in function '_on_detach'\n        /opt/neovim-temp/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/lsp/client.lua:1505: in function </opt/neovim-temp/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/lsp/client.lua:1503>\n```\n\n\n\n",
